    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i hear you but i really dont have the time or money for a doctor right now. i have some old amoxicillin from a previous prescription for a sinus thing, could i just take a dose of that to see if it clears it up? i feel like if i just get some antibiotics in my system the red line will just go away on its own. is that a better plan than waiting?",
